WEBVTT

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:01.670
Koyori, are you okay?

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:06.290
It's been two weeks since she woke up.

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:08.910
She can eat real food now,

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:10.800
including shumai!

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:16.860
She should be able to let go of 
your hand for about fifteen minutes.

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:20.930
But, without more data, it's hard to say.

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.900
I'm glad there's no problem.

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:27.020
She's actually healthier now
than when she was asleep.

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:32.620
I'll tell your parents about the food.

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:35.610
You going home for today?

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:38.740
No, we've got something to do.

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:41.160
Repairs again?

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:45.000
You haven't done what you 
were supposed to do for me!

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.270
If you're not in a hurry,

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:48.170
I'll prioritize my own job for today.

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:50.520
So mean!

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:52.500
Well, that's okay, I guess.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:57.080
And... there's something I 
want to try to make mesh.

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:42.830
This concludes the presentation 
on the introduction

00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:46.730
of the Centeotl Group's unit 
for the school cafeteria.

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:50.140
Thank you for listening.

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:53.720
I see.

00:03:53.720 --> 00:03:54.920
That would make it cheaper.

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.200
It's logical.

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:58.010
There's a lot of waste right now.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.600
That was easy to follow.

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:03.830
I think everyone liked it.

00:04:03.830 --> 00:04:05.510
Thank you.

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:08.760
Just hearing that makes me happy.

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:11.690
She really is a good employee, isn't she?

00:04:11.690 --> 00:04:13.930
I want one like her, too.

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:16.900
Thank you very much!

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:24.530
Wrong, Hayate!

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:28.880
I'm sorry people keep thinking I'm your boss.

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:30.780
Don't apologize.

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:32.010
You're the employee.

00:04:32.010 --> 00:04:33.890
I'm the boss.

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:37.790
Don't apologize. Tell them they're wrong!

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:42.050
I was thinking the same thing. Sorry.

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:44.050
I said don't apologize!

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:46.060
Well, forget it.

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:51.730
We never told them they were wrong.

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:53.810
What will you do next time?

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:55.260
Hmm...

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:56.810
Well, I'm sorry,

00:04:56.810 --> 00:05:00.820
but how about for this job we pretend 
I'm the boss and you're the employee?

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:02.540
Hey, Chizuru.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.820
Sorry, I'm blushing.

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:11.380
If you're going to
apologize, just don't do it.

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:14.830
I'll send them an email 
clearing up the confusion.

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:18.120
Sorry to make you do that.

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:21.100
It's nothing new, so it's fine.

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:23.210
Okay, all done.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:25.100
That was fast, Senpai!

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:27.980
There's research that says eating fast 
is bad for your health.

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:29.740
You're just slow!

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:32.160
You don't need to be in such a rush.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:33.770
Chew thoroughly before you swallow.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:36.950
Sorry I'm slow.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:38.900
Oh, Senpai.

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:40.430
Wh-What?

00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:42.030
There's rice on your face.

00:05:42.030 --> 00:05:43.120
Sorry.

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:45.530
I'll get it myself!

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:47.700
Jeez...

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:51.850
Thank you.

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:54.520
Nah, you're welcome.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:56.680
I'm always sorry for what I do.

00:05:56.680 --> 00:05:58.090
If you're going to apologize,

00:05:58.090 --> 00:06:00.620
just pay me back by working harder.

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:01.800
Got it!

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:08.630
You really are such a... jeez.

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:11.350
This is a good kitchen.

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:13.640
One of our units would work great here.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:17.560
I hope the deal keeps going well 
like it is now, Senpai.

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:18.890
Don't hope.

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:20.450
We're going to make it happen.

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:22.270
You and me.

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:24.020
Right! I'll do my best!

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:24.890
<i>Jeez...</i>

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:31.560
I think it's this...

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:33.780
Which means...

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:36.370
Yup, that's it.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:38.900
You really do learn fast.

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:41.440
Thanks.

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:42.620
It meshes!

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.650
Okay, next is the flathead screwdriver.

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:50.220
Thanks.

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:57.070
Thanks. You're just as good as everyone said.

00:06:57.070 --> 00:06:58.350
It's just emergency repairs.

00:06:58.790 --> 00:07:01.850
It would be best to swap it out if you can.

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:03.950
We're getting a new one.

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:06.360
We'll just keep making do until that happens.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:09.500
If anything else breaks, let me know.

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:11.130
I'm counting on you.

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:13.960
You two are good friends, huh?

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:18.940
No...

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:20.870
It's not like that.

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:23.530
Sorry.

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:25.000
Sorry!

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:28.470
Hey, I remember you.

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:29.510
Yeah...

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:32.550
Sorry about earlier.

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:34.890
What a coincidence.

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:36.890
You really helped me out last time.

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:38.590
Is your car working okay?

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:39.890
It's running fine.

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:41.760
Oh, right!

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:44.750
Your bike's a hybrid mountain bike, isn't it?

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:46.020
You can tell?

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:49.740
I've got one, too.

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:52.490
There's not a lot of people 
I can talk to about that.

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:53.770
I know!

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:55.880
Could I take a look at it?

00:07:55.880 --> 00:07:59.640
Sorry, I didn't bring my bike today.

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:02.000
Sorry...

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:06.060
Oh, I'm sorry. I didn't
introduce myself, either!

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:10.010
I'm Azuma Hayate with Centeotl Inc.

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:12.470
Nice to meet you.

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:14.820
Um, thanks.

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:16.640
I'm Takatsuki Tazuna.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:18.680
This is Akutagawa Koyori.

00:08:19.190 --> 00:08:21.310
Centeotl's the restaurant company?

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:25.130
Yup. Centeotl, that runs Cocktail Corn.

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:29.230
And giving a student a 
business card is weird!

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:30.490
Jeez!

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:32.000
Well...

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:34.280
Sorry I'm a grownup.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:35.720
Jeez...

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:38.280
Wait a second, young man!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.890
Listen. I'm not an intern,

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:43.910
or a middle-school student 
on take your daughter to work day!

00:08:44.390 --> 00:08:46.280
So you're in elementary school?

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:47.670
You're really grown up.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:50.140
You're going even lower?

00:08:50.140 --> 00:08:51.850
Th-That's not right!

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:54.270
Senpai may look like she's 
in elementary school,

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:55.630
but she's an adult.

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:57.680
She's also my boss, since she has 
more seniority than me.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:08:59.390
The way you say it,

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:00.600
if I wasn't your Senpai,

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:02.810
I wouldn't be anything special.

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:06.560
Sorry for saying the wrong thing.

00:09:06.810 --> 00:09:08.110
Jeez.

00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:10.140
Sorry.

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:11.790
I didn't realize you were older.

00:09:11.790 --> 00:09:13.530
Um...

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:17.820
I'm used to it. It's okay, young man.

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:21.240
This is our sales territory.

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:25.340
Part of our job is to open new stores 
and create operating plans for the area,

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:27.960
<b>Cocktail Corn</b>

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:27.960
so I'm also running Cocktail Corn.

00:09:30.580 --> 00:09:32.720
I'm just an ordinary employee.

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:37.430
Senpai is a highly experienced veteran. 
She's got years and years of experience.

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:40.300
Now you're making me sound old!

00:09:40.300 --> 00:09:41.970
I'm going to remember that.

00:09:43.830 --> 00:09:49.350
Anyway, thanks once again for 
helping us out, young man.

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:51.560
Tazuna-kun and Koyori-chan.

00:09:53.010 --> 00:09:54.480
I know!

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:57.320
You two seem to be close,

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:59.740
why don't you come to my 
restaurant for a date?

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:01.720
There's a park nearby,

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:05.500
so it's the perfect spot 
to take your girlfriend.

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:08.900
Girlfriend...?

00:10:11.680 --> 00:10:14.000
We're not like that...

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:15.600
<i>She can eat real food now,</i>

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:17.050
<i>including shumai!</i>

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:21.050
Want to go?

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:32.560
See you later.

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:34.440
Bye.

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:37.440
Koyori-chan's so cute, isn't she?

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:39.460
I picked that outfit.

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:52.460
Don't make her your doll...

00:10:59.060 --> 00:11:00.630
L-Let's go!

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:03.640
Take care.

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:08.660
I'll message if we're going to be late.

00:11:13.410 --> 00:11:14.310
Koyori?

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:20.440
I want to ride it,

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:22.200
but I can some other time.

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:27.190
Bye!

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:40.920
<b>Cocktail Corn</b>

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:43.900
Welcome!

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:46.200
Just the two of you, then?

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:47.930
Welcome!

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:50.430
H-Hello...

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:52.830
Oh, young man!

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:54.190
W-Welcome!

00:11:55.590 --> 00:11:58.440
Koyori-chan, you're so cute!

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:00.740
Excuse me, manager?

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:03.000
What is it?

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:04.060
The pies!

00:12:04.060 --> 00:12:05.700
Sorry, I forgot them!

00:12:05.980 --> 00:12:08.670
Manager, you forgot these, too!

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:10.470
I'm sorry!

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:12.760
Cute manager,

00:12:13.680 --> 00:12:16.590
about the customers at table #6...

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:18.210
Yeah, I'm going now.

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:22.970
Just so we're clear, it's a stupid 
nickname they came up with.

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:24.900
R-Right.

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:31.480
Okay, right this way.

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:34.650
Once you've decided what you want to order,

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:35.980
push the button.

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:39.390
Hayate's paying, so order whatever you want.

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:42.980
Enjoy.

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:47.270
What do you want?

00:12:47.270 --> 00:12:47.900
Here.

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:53.160
I see.

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:54.360
You don't know what it is.

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:57.710
It's a parfait with corn in it?

00:12:58.340 --> 00:12:59.900
Well, I guess it's okay,

00:12:59.900 --> 00:13:01.030
if that's what you want.

00:13:03.650 --> 00:13:05.720
Here you go!

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:07.970
Mixed berry pancakes,

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:09.220
hot coffee,

00:13:09.530 --> 00:13:11.470
and a corn parfait.

00:13:12.100 --> 00:13:13.960
Thank you.

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:16.070
You're welcome!

00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:18.750
The "corn" in that parfait is candy corn.

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:20.480
Glad to hear it.

00:13:20.780 --> 00:13:22.480
Enjoy!

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:25.370
Let's eat.

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:40.790
Is it good?

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:01.020
It is good!

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:12.280
It's so good.

00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:14.470
Thanks for the food!

00:14:21.540 --> 00:14:23.540
Do you still want more?

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:26.300
Was it good?

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:29.800
You can order more if you want.

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.420
No, but...

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:32.620
It's fine.

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:34.310
Senpai's paying.

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:37.930
Just order whatever you want.

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:39.760
Another parfait, right?

00:14:39.760 --> 00:14:41.060
Leave it to me.

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:42.940
Wait!

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:45.440
Senpai's so generous.

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:54.520
Thank you for everything today.

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:55.720
It's fine.

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:57.580
You really helped us.

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:01.040
I didn't think I'd have to pay for it all.

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:03.660
You're a grownup. No complaining.

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:05.840
Get your act together.

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:07.910
That hurt!

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:13.280
I think there are a lot of 
fun places around here.

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:14.620
Enjoy your date.

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:17.400
It's not like that, really.

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:20.100
So what's the deal then, young man?

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:25.560
It's not a date, but you're 
holding each other's hands!

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:38.940
If you were just a lovey-dovey couple,

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:41.290
I could've let you go and been jealous.

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:46.290
You knew we were Hand Shakers?

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:49.530
I figured I would pay our debt to you first.

00:15:50.280 --> 00:15:52.860
Time passes differently in the Ziggurat,

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:56.570
so you don't need to worry about our jobs.

00:15:57.110 --> 00:15:59.310
But I don't want to fight!

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:01.750
We will fight.

00:16:01.750 --> 00:16:03.080
We have a reason.

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:06.560
Sorry for deceiving you, Tazuna-kun.

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:09.260
Hayate! No apologizing!

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:10.820
Feeling guilty is just being weak,

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:13.220
and it's rude to them!

00:16:13.220 --> 00:16:14.420
Right.

00:16:16.610 --> 00:16:18.950
I wish things were different...

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:22.600
Poor thing. She pissed off the section chief.

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:25.040
She's done getting promotions, and will be 
sent to do sales in the middle of nowhere.

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:28.040
She seriously got involved in that 
faction dispute, didn't she?

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:30.010
She looks like a kid,

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:32.550
so she'll fit into a panda 
costume for the kids perfectly.

00:16:32.550 --> 00:16:35.050
An elementary-school manager.

00:16:35.050 --> 00:16:38.730
She's a kid, so she doesn't understand 
the subtleties of adult society.

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:42.730
What happens to my promotions?

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:44.510
I'm sorry!

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:46.270
I'm really sorry!

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:49.320
Are you just like that little girl?

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:50.740
I'm sorry!

00:16:51.560 --> 00:16:53.280
I'm sorry!

00:16:55.850 --> 00:17:01.610
I'm not a minor!

00:17:01.610 --> 00:17:03.620
This is always what happens.

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:07.330
They accidentally put the 
alcohol in front of me,

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:09.630
and I almost drank it.

00:17:09.930 --> 00:17:12.860
You pass out after a single drink, don't you?

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:17.100
I wish everything was the 
opposite, with you and me.

00:17:19.670 --> 00:17:21.210
I don't know.

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:25.640
Maybe not.

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:30.040
But what do you want, Senpai?

00:17:30.450 --> 00:17:31.400
Um...

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:34.280
If you can meet God...

00:17:35.030 --> 00:17:38.620
I don't know if God will 
really grant our wishes.

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:40.920
But...

00:17:40.920 --> 00:17:45.270
If He will, maybe I'll make everything equal.

00:17:45.270 --> 00:17:50.040
Prejudice, fighting, all that 
stupid stuff will disappear.

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:52.510
And the difference between your 
height and mine will disappear,

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:54.750
and no one will call me a minor again.

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:55.300
How about it?

00:17:58.740 --> 00:17:59.840
I like it!

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:01.040
I like it!

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:02.940
I'm sorry you're stuck with me,

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:04.810
but I'll help you with everything.

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:07.120
That's my subordinate!

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:08.640
That's my Azuma Hayate!

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:09.720
No self-deprecation!

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:10.940
No apologies!

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:13.160
Cheers to the Hand Shakers!

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:25.400
Young man!

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:29.790
You're both really good kids,

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:31.370
so don't hate me for this.

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:34.550
I'll give you my name.

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:36.010
Dagger Shadow!

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:39.090
That's me!

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:48.840
No!

00:18:57.010 --> 00:18:57.780
Run!

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:14.540
Now!

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:17.240
Let's run and reg—

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:19.170
What?

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:23.350
I didn't introduce him yet, did I?

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:24.920
Blade Shadow!

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:26.560
That's my subordinate!

00:19:29.910 --> 00:19:31.270
Damn it!

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:56.740
Two Nimrods...

00:19:57.600 --> 00:20:00.890
No, it's the same as with those chains.

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:04.710
Koyori doesn't have a Nimrod.

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:08.200
Is that young man just going to have 
to keep protecting you, Koyori-chan?

00:20:09.530 --> 00:20:13.460
Just because you're a girl doesn't 
mean you don't have to fight.

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:15.730
If you don't fight yourself,

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:18.230
your wish will end here!

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:26.760
Come on, what will you do?

00:20:30.100 --> 00:20:31.310
It's okay.

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:32.560
I'll do something.

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:35.290
You think you can do something like that?

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:43.220
She disappeared?

00:20:43.890 --> 00:20:44.860
Can you stand up?

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:11.420
Shadow clones!

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:22.920
No!

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:27.930
We win!

00:23:10.800 --> 00:23:12.620
<i>Countless blades attack without hesitation.</i>

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:14.910
<i>Are they wings, or a hurricane?</i>

00:23:14.910 --> 00:23:17.290
<i>Shadows strikes from a 
forest on a dark night.</i>

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:18.840
<i>Shadows! Shadows!</i>

00:23:19.550 --> 00:23:22.080
<i>The young girl who holds his 
hand has no way to fight.</i>

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:24.880
<i>Alone, the young boy spins the gears.</i>

00:23:24.880 --> 00:23:27.720
<i>The stars of another world 
sparkle in the sky above</i>

00:23:27.720 --> 00:23:29.390
<i>as Tazuna makes his decision.</i>

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:33.930
<i>Next time on Hand Shakers,
Episode 4: Live Lab.</i>

00:23:34.420 --> 00:23:36.640
<i>Friendship after a fierce battle.</i>

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:39.310
<i>Not everyone in this fight is your enemy.</i>
